OL,3,GNEWSABereaved dad who 'lost running
OL,4,Aspirit' to run GNR
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will be raising funds for charity
OL,7,FQuinn's Retreat, which offers a free
OL,8,Fbreak in static caravans in Barnard
OL,9,FCastle and Appleby, Cumbria, for people
OL,10,Fwho have been similarly bereaved.
